# The calculator's PLAINTEXT source.
#
# tools/ is served by GitHub Pages (verified: tools/build.py returns 200), and
# this repository is public — so committing the unencrypted app would publish
# the very thing calculator/index.html encrypts. Only the ciphertext ships.
#
# Keep a backup of this file somewhere safe: without it the calculator cannot
# be rebuilt or edited, only decrypted in a browser.
tools/calc/app.html
